00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:28.340
Well, we had a little mishap in the lab this week.

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.000
We were trying to make a cold fusion...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.420
Walkman, and I don't know what happened, but...

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.160
Well, you see what happened.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:37.060
Anyway, well, Dr. Forrester will be here in a second.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.900
He's just trying to make himself look presentable.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.480
Just make with the invention exchange, wild boy.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:42.950
Oh, okay, well...

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:46.740
This is an invention in honor of the party today that the robots are throwing.

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.280
When I was a boy, I used to play with one of these.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:53.080
All right.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.820
And now, uh...

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:56.610
