00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.660
Maybe our hair.

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:25.580
Nothing wrong with my hair, Larry.

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:27.340
Jeepers.

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.930
You guys look like something from a West...

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.720
Craven's children's book.

