There she is.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:52.200
Mom?

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:52.660
Yeah.

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:54.520
Fuck, it looks like a volcano to me.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:10.890
Hey, why does he need a pipe? Why doesn't he just suck in some air?

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:13.560
Feel the pumice power. It'll work on your lungs.

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.140
...and that volcano looks as far away as it ever did.

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:18.980
Nobody stuck a gun in your back to make you become a geologist.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:21.060
Yeah, but you don't have to rub it in.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:25.790
Hey, look. Looks like it's from the old MASH cell.

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.880
You know, if there's any other village within 50 miles of here...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:37.040
time like this could confuse people. Huh? Huh? I don't get it. Ah, it looks like somebody else has been through here lately.

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:43.200
Yeah, army truck maybe. Police. Hey, wait, that's my motorman's helper. Don't get me wrong, Doc.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:47.340
I love this Mexico of yours, but... But I like my Mexico better. Got a little

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:51.550
plastic burrow? It's me. For my information, Hank. How did you get permission so fast?

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:55.640
For my group, I mean. After all, red tape and that sort of thing. Simple.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.940
Just told them the truth. That you needed me along as an interpreter. And to mop up your

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.300
sweat.

