That may be true.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:07.190
Well I think the language you really spoke fast was with our secretary who secured all

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:08.150
the documents for you.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:10.070
Oh, I didn't use Spanish with her.

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:11.210
I used Greek.

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:13.030
It really confused the hell out of her.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:14.190
Incredible.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:23.870
Truly isn't it?

