If these estimates are right, this quake may be as severe as Mont Paley.

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:29.270
This driving effect?

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:33.850
San Francisco. Lucky there are so few people up here.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:35.900
Well, there were enough.

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:41.150
Meanwhile, on a pool somewhere.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:47.310
Oh, hi, linesman.

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:48.840
How far you come, fellas?

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:51.020
Mexico City. We left on Monday.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:52.090
