00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.540
San Lorenzo. How far is it, you know?

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:56.430
Who knows how the bridges are?

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:57.570
The bridges are?

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:59.960
A police car went by just before sundown.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.940
