00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.280
Who knows?

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:09.200
The telephone line is out down since the earthquake.

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:11.330
Thanks a lot.

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:12.300
See you later.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:12.980
Take it easy.

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:13.460
Goodbye.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:14.500
See you later.

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:15.700
Auf Wiedersehen.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:16.730
Hasta luego.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.180
Boy, am I hungry.

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:27.220
Is that my stomach growling or yours?

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:39.870
What kind of oil mixture do you use?

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:59.510
How does move this high voltage power line with this piece of metal?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.220
I'm going to dip it in water first.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:15.980
Nest station never looked better.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.990
Hello? Anybody home?

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.070
I can find a well.

