He's dead, you...

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:41.750
Idiot.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:44.350
Thank you.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.080
I got a wax museum in my ear.

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:55.730
