00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:02.710
Hello, hello?

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:03.530
Hello, hello?

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.550
We only found Sergeant Vega and the baby.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:10.080
Right, you said Vega's revolver had all chambers fired.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:11.710
Yes, all.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:14.570
We wish we knew too.

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:17.860
Emergency unit will be in San Lorenzo tomorrow.

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:19.680
