00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.650
What do you think that announcer looks like?

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.510
Picture him kind of tall, good-looking.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:24.930
You?

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:25.870
I don't know.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.710
The San Lorenzo Milling Around Festival.

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:35.350
Hey, G.I. Joe, number one.

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:37.390
Hey, mister, my sister, boobly-oobly.

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:37.770
Chocolate.

