Okay, now ask him in French.

00:16:57.900 --> 00:16:59.080
Okay, do German again.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:16:59.760
I love this.

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:02.460
Arturo Ramos of the University.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.890
Dr. Henry Scott from the United States.

